/ Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UPV0hQdljQIQ7kNvwGyiO3E&_nc_oc=Adp4zLv2OIqphcSqNZFbSpF4m4AxCn3Br_g5GUxZT3CxlSopeOG1JGfDlw9afiVwwOQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSfRQuOh3V9VCQxMGtJuhHV6blyCvwmOSakPDhKXFFEJg&oe=6AEF4283"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BndqZD2_AJgQ7kNvwEb76ol&_nc_oc=Adqab_e39U3QBbDCFDLvl-mULf0dKGaI4wi6WxK88D3q0z6udzrNlKt59K0lW_51kpE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTGCeNxaHbaBub3K3y7P-OOsVvhai4jpIdmnqc_lASWDQ&oe=6AEF3AD8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SxAfRy8BbhQQ7kNvwFAiARR&_nc_oc=AdqG_tgPDzQODlB3KbmDgtV5p2Wyzj5yKaiKmSBu_kqMYGdARnN4w7L9gTstMSSM1j0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2